WEBVTT

00:00:01.030 --> 00:00:07.400
I can't come to hate you,
but it's just really not enough.

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:15.230
Did you know that when you think
about it, you know little about yourself?

00:00:17.610 --> 00:00:21.050
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:00:21.150 --> 00:00:26.210
When you're about
to give up all hope, look at the sky...

00:00:27.620 --> 00:00:33.110
...because the wind
will gently dry all your tears.

00:00:34.290 --> 00:00:37.090
And then the light
that floods down...

00:00:37.430 --> 00:00:44.060
...from the big stars in the sky will come
down and gently wrap all around you.

00:00:47.410 --> 00:00:52.210
A magical jewel...
Everything you want...

00:00:52.340 --> 00:00:59.410
...is in a haze much thicker
than any dream you have had.

00:00:59.620 --> 00:01:05.650
I can't come to hate you,
but it's just really not enough.

00:01:06.660 --> 00:01:11.620
I have my faith that what I feel is all true.

00:01:12.630 --> 00:01:19.060
Breaking through the wall of steel,
I can now see on the other side.

00:01:19.710 --> 00:01:26.980
The sea that opens to tomorrow,
and it will be shining for me.

00:01:33.650 --> 00:01:35.850
I will now go revive...

00:01:36.790 --> 00:01:38.120
...Hikaru's sword.

00:01:38.990 --> 00:01:42.590
Be sure to come back
after reviving the sword.

00:01:44.430 --> 00:01:45.520
I will.

00:01:47.870 --> 00:01:50.060
What is your real name?

00:01:50.970 --> 00:01:52.900
My name is Presea.

00:01:53.270 --> 00:01:56.000
Presea, master smith of Cephiro.

00:02:10.190 --> 00:02:12.490
Is your heart ready for this?

00:02:13.390 --> 00:02:16.290
This is a battle
that I chose for myself.

00:02:16.390 --> 00:02:18.420
I decided this as well...

00:02:19.630 --> 00:02:23.530
That I want to fight together
with Rayearth once more!

00:02:24.300 --> 00:02:26.360
And with Umi and Fuu.

00:02:41.290 --> 00:02:47.250
Hikaru and Friendships Torn Apart

00:03:02.410 --> 00:03:03.500
Hikaru!

00:03:03.810 --> 00:03:04.900
Hikaru!

00:03:13.150 --> 00:03:15.920
Hikaru, please, look to the light.

00:03:18.290 --> 00:03:20.380
Don't walk toward the shadows!

00:03:28.830 --> 00:03:29.930
Nova...

00:03:30.340 --> 00:03:33.240
You don't have to worry
about anything anymore.

00:03:33.340 --> 00:03:36.100
You can stay here with me forever.

00:03:37.440 --> 00:03:39.380
Think just of me.

00:03:40.110 --> 00:03:41.740
Look only at me.

00:03:41.850 --> 00:03:46.680
You can't let anyone else
into your heart, Hikaru.

00:03:49.250 --> 00:03:50.310
Umi...

00:03:50.420 --> 00:03:51.390
Fuu...

00:03:52.190 --> 00:03:54.850
You still remember those two?

00:03:59.260 --> 00:04:00.860
Remember, Hikaru...

00:04:01.200 --> 00:04:04.790
Were Umi and Fuu
really nice to you, Hikaru?

00:04:05.600 --> 00:04:09.040
Umi and Fuu were always kind to me.

00:04:09.410 --> 00:04:13.070
They're important teammates
who fought in Cephiro with me.

00:04:13.180 --> 00:04:14.870
Is that really so?

00:04:14.980 --> 00:04:18.420
Are you sure you're not
remembering things differently?

00:04:19.480 --> 00:04:21.250
Don't make that face...

00:04:24.120 --> 00:04:26.490
It's your fault that all this happened.

00:04:26.590 --> 00:04:27.720
Umi?

00:04:28.660 --> 00:04:33.690
Because we would not have had
to go to Cephiro if you were not there.

00:04:33.800 --> 00:04:34.890
Fuu?

00:04:38.040 --> 00:04:39.130
Umi...

00:04:39.370 --> 00:04:40.400
Fuu...

00:04:40.510 --> 00:04:41.560
Why?

00:04:42.640 --> 00:04:44.800
The three of us talked this over...

00:04:44.910 --> 00:04:49.440
That no matter what happened,
we would never drift apart...

00:04:51.450 --> 00:04:54.890
That we would fight
for our hearts together...

00:04:55.250 --> 00:04:59.210
...like when the three of us
became Magic Knights.

00:05:00.060 --> 00:05:04.360
That we would fight together
to the end without losing anyone.

00:05:05.260 --> 00:05:07.030
I don't want to.

00:05:07.300 --> 00:05:08.790
Neither do I.

00:05:10.300 --> 00:05:11.390
Umi...

00:05:11.600 --> 00:05:12.700
Fuu...

00:05:14.340 --> 00:05:16.570
There were three Rune-Gods.

00:05:17.310 --> 00:05:20.400
So if the three of us
hadn't been together...

00:05:20.880 --> 00:05:23.810
...we might never have
been summoned to Cephiro.

00:05:24.580 --> 00:05:27.350
We have nothing to do with Cephiro.

00:05:27.950 --> 00:05:32.290
Why do we, inhabitants of
another world, have to fight for them?

00:05:35.560 --> 00:05:37.220
This isn't true...

00:05:37.700 --> 00:05:41.290
Cephiro is not
the world that we live in.

00:05:41.870 --> 00:05:44.630
It is not our business,
whatever happens!

00:05:45.600 --> 00:05:47.130
This isn't true...

00:05:47.240 --> 00:05:51.070
I don't care about Cephiro anymore.

00:05:51.180 --> 00:05:54.870
I want to forget the last battle
already and go back to Tokyo.

00:05:54.980 --> 00:05:56.410
This isn't true!

00:06:08.060 --> 00:06:12.890
The struggle that began when
Princess Emeraude summoned us...

00:06:13.000 --> 00:06:14.970
We can never forget it.

00:06:15.270 --> 00:06:17.930
It was because we couldn't forget...

00:06:18.040 --> 00:06:23.740
...that the three of us promised
to fight with our hearts together!

00:06:24.580 --> 00:06:26.570
I'll keep my promise!

00:06:26.680 --> 00:06:28.170
Umi and Fuu...

00:06:28.880 --> 00:06:32.610
...would definitely keep
the promise we made to each other.

00:06:33.280 --> 00:06:35.380
So this just isn't true!

00:06:38.060 --> 00:06:39.180
I see...

00:06:39.560 --> 00:06:41.550
You really believe in those two.

00:06:46.500 --> 00:06:48.260
Then what about this?

00:06:56.570 --> 00:06:57.770
Lantis...

00:06:58.610 --> 00:07:01.410
You're in love with
this person, right, Hikaru?

00:07:04.080 --> 00:07:07.020
It's different from your
feelings for those two.

00:07:07.450 --> 00:07:09.280
But it's still love.

00:07:13.930 --> 00:07:17.380
Hey, what do you think of Hikaru?

00:07:18.660 --> 00:07:22.760
The Magic Knights killed
my elder brother, Zagato.

00:07:30.110 --> 00:07:32.630
Hey, do you love Hikaru?

00:07:48.830 --> 00:07:50.520
You're so weak, Hikaru!

00:07:50.630 --> 00:07:53.060
You're so weak and so cute, Hikaru!

00:07:54.200 --> 00:07:57.130
Lantis!

00:08:04.910 --> 00:08:06.100
Hikaru...

00:08:06.980 --> 00:08:08.040
Hikaru!

00:08:12.650 --> 00:08:16.380
An evil presence
has entered this castle.

00:08:18.890 --> 00:08:21.590
But this presence is Hikaru's...

00:08:25.860 --> 00:08:26.960
Hikaru!

00:08:31.100 --> 00:08:32.070
Lantis!

00:08:32.170 --> 00:08:33.260
Mister!

00:08:35.610 --> 00:08:37.300
What's wrong, Lantis?

00:08:37.980 --> 00:08:39.840
Are you all right?

00:08:40.750 --> 00:08:42.470
Hikaru is in danger.

00:08:42.650 --> 00:08:43.580
Hikaru?

00:08:43.980 --> 00:08:45.420
That short girl?

00:08:49.850 --> 00:08:52.250
What happened with Ms. Hikaru?

00:08:54.660 --> 00:08:56.130
She's okay, right?

00:08:56.230 --> 00:08:58.020
She's so strong!

00:09:05.770 --> 00:09:07.140
She is all right.

00:09:07.240 --> 00:09:11.870
Here in Cephiro, those with
truly strong willpower always prevail.

00:09:12.880 --> 00:09:14.340
Hikaru is strong.

00:09:16.450 --> 00:09:19.380
She has a heart
stronger than anyone else's.

00:09:23.220 --> 00:09:24.250
This...

00:09:25.190 --> 00:09:28.180
I made this with flowers
from the residential quarter.

00:09:28.490 --> 00:09:30.930
I wanted to give it to her.

00:09:33.530 --> 00:09:36.300
Flowers bloom even without a Pillar.

00:09:37.200 --> 00:09:38.130
All right.

00:09:40.610 --> 00:09:43.370
I will make sure to give it to Hikaru.

00:09:50.110 --> 00:09:51.100
Hikaru!

00:10:03.330 --> 00:10:06.920
Not yet... Hikaru's heart
hasn't filled with shadows yet.

00:10:14.510 --> 00:10:16.800
I will go inside Hikaru's heart.

00:10:19.840 --> 00:10:24.140
I will go inside Hikaru's heart
and make sure to call her back.

00:10:28.990 --> 00:10:30.420
It's all right.

00:10:30.720 --> 00:10:33.990
Hikaru is strong.
I know we'll make it back.

00:10:35.290 --> 00:10:36.560
And then...

00:10:38.600 --> 00:10:42.430
She will be able to revive
her sword with her own will.

00:11:01.490 --> 00:11:04.010
Presea, protect Hikaru...

00:11:08.430 --> 00:11:13.560
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:11:15.430 --> 00:11:19.560
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:11:31.950 --> 00:11:33.250
How's Ascot?

00:11:33.950 --> 00:11:36.220
Sleeping in his room.

00:11:38.390 --> 00:11:40.320
It wasn't just his body.

00:11:40.660 --> 00:11:43.180
His heart has matured as well.

00:11:43.530 --> 00:11:46.960
People change when they
have someone to care about.

00:11:54.710 --> 00:11:57.370
Hey, hey, did you
change too, Lafarga?

00:11:58.410 --> 00:11:59.670
Change what?

00:11:59.780 --> 00:12:02.370
Did you change after fallin' for me?

00:12:02.480 --> 00:12:04.280
W-What are you saying?

00:12:05.450 --> 00:12:06.780
I swear...

00:12:10.660 --> 00:12:11.920
Caldina...

00:12:12.460 --> 00:12:15.890
I'm originally from Chizeta.

00:12:16.090 --> 00:12:20.830
To tell the truth, what happens to
Cephiro don't have much to do with me.

00:12:20.930 --> 00:12:24.420
I fought in the previous battle
because I was bein' paid.

00:12:24.540 --> 00:12:28.600
I was thinkin' of goin' on
another journey when I got my cash.

00:12:32.780 --> 00:12:37.680
But after seein' you workin'
so hard to evacuate everyone...

00:12:37.780 --> 00:12:42.910
...without even thinkin' twice about
it as Cephiro crumbled around you...

00:12:46.420 --> 00:12:48.360
I fell in love...

00:12:49.930 --> 00:12:56.830
Well, I've always gone for the serious,
stubborn, and misunderstood types.

00:13:00.810 --> 00:13:04.830
I was controlled during the battle
brought on by High Priest Zagato...

00:13:04.940 --> 00:13:06.910
...and I couldn't do anything.

00:13:07.010 --> 00:13:10.810
That's why I want to fight
so I have no regrets this time.

00:13:12.180 --> 00:13:14.120
To protect Cephiro?

00:13:16.720 --> 00:13:21.490
And to protect you,
who decided to stay in this country.

00:13:42.810 --> 00:13:46.080
I just can't stand macho types!

00:13:47.250 --> 00:13:48.280
Huh?

00:13:48.720 --> 00:13:49.780
Huh?

00:13:59.700 --> 00:14:01.670
I seem to be all right.

00:14:37.840 --> 00:14:42.170
Since I was kidnapped by
those weird spirits, this must be...

00:14:43.710 --> 00:14:45.770
It is Chizeta's fortress.

00:14:45.880 --> 00:14:46.970
Selece.

00:14:48.350 --> 00:14:50.210
Girl from another world.

00:14:50.310 --> 00:14:54.580
When thou lost consciousness,
I was returned to my dimension.

00:14:55.050 --> 00:14:58.580
If danger besets thee, call my name.

00:14:59.590 --> 00:15:01.060
All right.

00:15:04.660 --> 00:15:05.750
Hey...

00:15:06.760 --> 00:15:07.890
Selece...

00:15:08.530 --> 00:15:09.630
What?

00:15:11.200 --> 00:15:16.270
I once thought that you
were pretty scary, Selece...

00:15:18.480 --> 00:15:20.070
...but you're kind.

00:15:22.250 --> 00:15:25.270
You should tell me
about yourself sometime.

00:15:25.380 --> 00:15:27.910
About how
you spent all those eons...

00:15:28.050 --> 00:15:30.490
Tell me your memories.

00:15:32.790 --> 00:15:35.780
As you wish, girl from another world.

00:15:36.460 --> 00:15:37.720
I'm Umi.

00:15:38.100 --> 00:15:42.730
I call you by name, Selece, so I
want you to call me by my name too.

00:15:43.970 --> 00:15:45.160
Umi.

00:15:45.600 --> 00:15:47.330
Thank you, Selece.

00:15:47.740 --> 00:15:51.140
If I'm ever in danger,
I'll be sure to call your name.

00:16:03.420 --> 00:16:05.220
What do you want?

00:16:10.060 --> 00:16:13.000
W-Wait, what do
you think you're doing?

00:16:17.500 --> 00:16:18.470
Hikaru!

00:16:18.570 --> 00:16:19.540
Fuu!

00:16:29.250 --> 00:16:31.480
As I thought, this is locked.

00:17:01.710 --> 00:17:06.120
That was similar to the dancing
lion we fought previously.

00:17:06.220 --> 00:17:09.810
That means I am probably
inside the dragon of Fahren.

00:17:10.520 --> 00:17:12.490
Girl from another world.

00:17:12.760 --> 00:17:13.820
Windam!

00:17:14.290 --> 00:17:17.730
Dost thou know thy situation?

00:17:18.400 --> 00:17:19.420
Yes.

00:17:20.060 --> 00:17:21.590
Believe in thyself.

00:17:21.700 --> 00:17:24.000
Lose not thy strength of heart.

00:17:24.100 --> 00:17:27.400
If thou art calm,
the path will open before thee.

00:17:28.140 --> 00:17:29.230
Right.

00:17:30.040 --> 00:17:31.700
Where are you now?

00:17:31.810 --> 00:17:36.250
When thou lost consciousness,
I was returned to my dimension.

00:17:36.710 --> 00:17:40.210
If danger besets thee, call my name.

00:17:40.950 --> 00:17:42.710
Thank you very much.

00:17:43.490 --> 00:17:48.620
That reminds me... I have been
calling you Windam all this time.

00:17:48.730 --> 00:17:50.660
Is that acceptable?

00:17:51.200 --> 00:17:52.630
What is wrong?

00:17:53.360 --> 00:17:56.130
Should I be calling you Sir Windam?

00:17:56.230 --> 00:18:03.940
But then I would have to raise
my sword and call, "Sir Windam!"

00:18:08.180 --> 00:18:09.870
Call me Windam.

00:18:11.420 --> 00:18:14.320
Then call me Fuu as well.

00:18:18.160 --> 00:18:19.250
Okay?

00:18:20.520 --> 00:18:21.620
Fuu.

00:18:22.760 --> 00:18:26.720
That makes me happy. Please
continue to provide me with advice.

00:18:45.020 --> 00:18:46.950
Pleased to meet you.

00:18:48.590 --> 00:18:50.820
Ms. Hikaru... Ms. Umi...

00:18:50.920 --> 00:18:53.250
I wonder if they are all right.

00:18:54.630 --> 00:18:55.720
Ferio...

00:18:56.430 --> 00:18:57.550
Ferio...

00:19:09.740 --> 00:19:11.830
The Magic Knights are divided.

00:19:13.940 --> 00:19:17.540
One is in Chizeta's
mobile fortress, Bravada.

00:19:17.650 --> 00:19:20.520
Another is inside Fahren's
mobile weapon, Dome.

00:19:21.920 --> 00:19:24.980
Only Hikaru is
currently in Cephiro's castle.

00:19:26.390 --> 00:19:28.480
That cute little miss...

00:19:29.790 --> 00:19:34.390
The proof of the Pillar that Lantis told
us about is likely inside that castle.

00:19:36.900 --> 00:19:40.300
Now would be the time
to invade the castle of Cephiro.

00:19:41.440 --> 00:19:42.460
Eagle.

00:19:42.570 --> 00:19:43.730
Yes?

00:19:45.010 --> 00:19:46.940
Is it all right?

00:19:53.550 --> 00:19:58.550
I thought you and Lantis trusted each
other and that you were best friends.

00:20:00.890 --> 00:20:06.730
And that was why Lantis, a traveler,
stayed in Autozam all that time.

00:20:10.030 --> 00:20:15.970
Lantis trusted you and told only
you many secrets about Cephiro.

00:20:16.870 --> 00:20:21.970
That quiet guy discussed
his deepest feelings with you.

00:20:22.950 --> 00:20:24.180
And yet...

00:20:26.420 --> 00:20:28.350
Is it really all right?

00:20:30.990 --> 00:20:32.920
It doesn't matter anymore...

00:20:35.060 --> 00:20:36.990
It doesn't matter anymore.

00:20:37.600 --> 00:20:38.930
You...

00:20:48.510 --> 00:20:49.470
Eagle?

00:20:52.440 --> 00:20:54.740
Eagle, are you all right? Eagle!

00:20:57.920 --> 00:20:59.040
Eagle...

00:21:00.990 --> 00:21:01.920
Zazu!

00:21:02.290 --> 00:21:02.920
Zazu!

00:21:02.920 --> 00:21:04.220
Zazu!
Stop it!

00:21:10.760 --> 00:21:12.350
Sorry for yelling.

00:21:12.600 --> 00:21:14.860
But I'm all right...

00:21:17.870 --> 00:21:21.000
So you have been
hiding something from me...

00:21:22.610 --> 00:21:25.300
I wonder why I have such bad timing...

00:21:25.380 --> 00:21:28.970
To be like this in front of you, Geo...

00:21:30.880 --> 00:21:34.040
If I had died from
this disease a little sooner...

00:21:34.150 --> 00:21:36.950
...I might not have
had to betray Lantis.

00:21:38.060 --> 00:21:41.990
When we heard the Pillar was gone
and I was assigned to invade Cephiro...

00:21:42.090 --> 00:21:45.260
...it was on that day
that the symptoms began.

00:21:45.360 --> 00:21:47.300
It doesn't matter anymore...

00:21:47.400 --> 00:21:52.430
If I'll die anyway, it doesn't matter what
Lantis thinks since I'll be beyond pain.

00:21:52.540 --> 00:21:53.730
Eagle...

00:22:17.900 --> 00:22:23.330
You are like the fast wind that blows
across the surface of the ocean.

00:22:23.970 --> 00:22:31.240
And all the dreams you have are always
engulfed in infinite rays of sunlight.

00:22:32.710 --> 00:22:38.240
I don't want to see you with your back
turned to me like you are right now.

00:22:38.950 --> 00:22:42.750
Heading toward the future,
both your wings are broken...

00:22:43.120 --> 00:22:45.520
...yet you hide your pain from me.

00:22:47.320 --> 00:22:50.620
Softly...
Let me wipe all your tears away.

00:22:51.000 --> 00:22:54.360
Softly...
Let me hold you in my embrace.

00:22:54.770 --> 00:23:01.690
Softly... Let me comfort you in my arms
because I want you to be at peace.

00:23:02.110 --> 00:23:05.540
I'll give you... I'll give you...

00:23:05.840 --> 00:23:14.270
Even if you rest your wings now, the
dreams that you see now will not end...

00:23:17.120 --> 00:23:20.450
I'll give you... I'll give you...

00:23:20.690 --> 00:23:28.760
If you have a heart that believes,
I'm sure it will be of help to you...

00:23:30.830 --> 00:23:37.640
I'll give you my love lullaby...

00:23:46.480 --> 00:23:48.540
I'm Umi Ryuuzaki!

00:23:48.650 --> 00:23:50.050
Where am I?

00:23:50.150 --> 00:23:53.390
I know I was captured
by those disgusting spirits...

00:23:53.490 --> 00:23:57.520
Could I be inside
Chizeta's mobile fortress, Bravada?

00:23:57.830 --> 00:24:01.160
And what's this outfit? And this cage?

00:24:01.270 --> 00:24:03.500
I'm not a beast!

00:24:03.900 --> 00:24:05.560
Magic Knight Rayearth...

00:24:05.670 --> 00:24:08.190
Umi and the Ambition of Tarta & Tatra.

00:24:08.310 --> 00:24:09.370
You have to watch it!

00:24:09.370 --> 00:24:10.410
Umi and the Ambition of Tarta & Tatra
You have to watch it!

00:24:10.410 --> 00:24:13.380
Umi and the Ambition of Tarta & Tatra

00:24:13.380 --> 00:24:21.310
Who is it today?

00:24:21.490 --> 00:24:23.280
Today, it is Ms. Umi!

00:24:23.390 --> 00:24:23.990
Look forward to the next episode!

00:24:23.990 --> 00:24:26.290
Look forward to the next episode!
Hey, everyone! Did you guess right?

00:24:26.290 --> 00:24:28.290
Look forward to the next episode!
I'll see you later!

00:24:28.290 --> 00:24:29.350
Look forward to the next episode!
